  "body": "A user managed to pass in a string to the `app_service_config_files` config option (https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-appservice-irc/issues/1696) and synapse happily \"accepted\" it with a warning. I think this probably should have crashed Synapse, rather than allowing them to proceed and thinking something might be wrong with the bridge. ",
